# Scenario 'mail_compose': メールをかく: write a mail (address, title, body), save it, look at it in the mail check screen
# Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile' (adapter registered, nickname set), fake Internet on.
# Every section shows a first-use tutorial the first time it is entered; SELECT ("おわる") skips it.
# Keyboards: A types the highlighted key, START jumps to OK, A on OK confirms.
# All screen names are from reading the Japanese screens (screenshots), not from the code.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # enter メール (first-use tutorial page)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap SELECT                   # skip tutorial
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot compose1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A x4
tap START
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
wait 60
tap A x3
wait 30
shot subj_typed
tap START
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot body_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot body_kbd
tap A x5
wait 30
shot body_typed
tap START
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_body
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot s1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot s2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot s3
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot s4
